	)
	(text "Distortion / overdrive pedal, Linework series. Audio path, version 0.1.\nBased on GS1 (MXR Distortion+) with Soft/Hard clipping, a DS-1 style Tone control,\na x4 output amplifier and digital pots for Gain, Tone and Level.\nValues match the LTspice model in pedals/distortion/sim/Flashover_circuit.inc."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 45.72 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "e89dd160-9e3c-4718-9846-3317ae7b43b1")
	)
	(text "Signal flow:  Input and Gain  ->  Clipping  ->  Tone and Output"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 99.06 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "ea330198-67fe-463c-b896-81592092e5c9")
	)
	(text "Still to be drawn (later sheets):\n- Controller: microcontroller, digital pot SPI bus, HARD_SEL, firmware/preset memory\n- Controls: three endless encoders with LED rings, Soft/Hard button with two LEDs\n- MIDI in / MIDI out (Linework loop)\n- Bypass relay, footswitch and status LED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 121.92 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "317fa014-3d4e-4618-8d10-6f9098cb9d37")
	)
